CCAAVVEEAATTSS
     Support for 802.11n 40MHz channels and Tx aggregation is not yet imple‐
     mented.  Additional work is required in ieee80211(9) before those fea‐
     tures can be supported.

     On USB devices, Host AP mode is limited to 7 concurrent clients and does
     not support power saving.  Clients attempting to use power saving mode
     may experience significant packet loss.

